  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Temporary Shelter for Survivors of Human Trafficking in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">These funds will provide an extension to a current project that provides holistic recovery and reintegration services to female victims of trafficking. WHI will continue to work with village parent groups to prevent trafficking from rural areas to the cities, and to facilitate the reintegration of survivors. WHI will also continue its collaborative work with community anti-trafficking groups, local law enforcement personnel and victim service providers to develop a coordinated response to TIP through service provision and raising TIP awareness.</narrative>
  </description>
